					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271003,
					"content": "啊，對不起！難道說妳是在狩獵？我們不小心打擾了妳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271004,
					"content": "#我沒有在狩獵。{F#妳}{M#你}們也沒有打擾我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271005,
					"content": "呃…那妳這是在…發呆？比方說…在想好吃的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271006,
					"content": "我也沒在想妳的事情。我在思考。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271007,
					"content": "思考…不對，妳前半句話是什麼意思啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271008,
					"content": "#我在思考{NICKNAME}之前的問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271009,
					"content": "「如果人類活動也是自然法則的一部分，該如何看待人類。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271010,
					"content": "浮錦和蛇，她們離開後，我太久沒有接觸過組成聚落的人類了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271011,
					"content": "妳這話說的，小茂不也是人類嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271012,
					"content": "#小茂是屬於聚落的人類，而不是組成聚落的人類。妳和{NICKNAME}「組成」了旅行的同伴，而不「屬於」{NICKNAME}。這就是區別。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271013,
						711271015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271013,
					"content": "妳認為小茂不是社會秩序的一部分？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711271014,
					"content": "還沒有完全成為這種秩序的一部分。人類的幼崽幾乎都是這樣，直到他們被這種秩序徹底塗抹，就像是自然那樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271017,
					"content": "我太久沒有接觸過組成聚落的人類了。或許是出於厭惡，或許是出於恐懼——或許兩者皆有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271018,
						711271019
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271018,
					"content": "因為他們侵佔了屬於自然的土地？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711271020,
					"content": "我不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271021
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271021,
					"content": "也許沒有明顯的區別可以劃分「我們」和「他們」，但我無法確定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271022
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271022,
					"content": "人類的幼崽會與我同行，我也有年幼的同族，出於好奇選擇與人類同行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271023
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271023,
					"content": "欸？年幼的同族？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271024,
					"content": "那孩子在山中遇到了煙火氣的人類，",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271025
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271025,
					"content": "#所以，我現在依然沒辦法回答{F#妳}{M#你}的問題。我需要繼續觀察人類。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271026,
					"content": "#許多事情，我不理解。我會試著理解，直到我能夠按照約定，回答{F#妳}{M#你}的問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271019,
					"content": "因為浮錦為了他們選擇犧牲自己？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711271015,
					"content": "這不太好說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271016
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711271016,
					"content": "喂！不要說這麼奇怪的話啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
