					"nextDialogs": [
						711271202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271202,
					"content": "怎麼了，靈淵？一直盯著我看，我身上有什麼奇怪的東西嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮錦"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271203,
					"content": "我只是在想…不，沒什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271204,
					"content": "就算妳和蛇一起要求，我也不會再化成人形了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271205,
					"content": "呵呵，我也沒要求過妳呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711271206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮錦"
				},
				{
					"id": 711271206,
					"content": "算了…走吧。妳不是還要去看現在的茶園嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "靈淵"
